        "\"Complete our team's experiment at the Honkai Energy Sample Spectral Analysis Array. Really measure the energy flow transfer and suppression effect under the same input, and completely record the consumption and residual output; the original amount of the tested object will be returned, and the experiment will be subject to the actual settlement of the machine.\"",
        "\"After the experiment is completed, choose 580 research points or HDV circuit × 4, tungsten steel plate × 56 to pay the base fee; an additional 7,200 ticks and 515,396,075,520 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\"",
