        "\"After the experiment is completed, choose 2160 research points or QAV circuit × 6, silica alloy plate × 88 to pay the base fee; an additional 18,000 ticks and 131,941,395,333,120 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected according to the advanced level.\"",
        "\"The research institute withholds power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the empty shell and interface manufacturing of the Soul Steel Precision Machining Center, the assembly sealing and field calibration conditions of the imitation God's Key Assembly Center will be unlocked, and the official empty world bubble containment container will be produced; there is no requirement to capture the world bubble first.\""
